<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20643" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουνός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hill, mound</i>, Cyrenaic word,
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.199
			</span></i>; freq. in Syracusan poets, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				333
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				17.9
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.83.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				289.168
			</span></i> (Rhodian, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1129.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>heap</i> of stones, etc., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				31.46
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					58.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clot</i> of blood, <i><span class="en">
				Cyr.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβος</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόμβοι</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>altar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιβάς</span>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>), Id. (Barbarous word acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				93
			</span></i>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
